<title>INDIA: Indian yr/yr inflation rises to 7.99 pct in week.</title>
<headline>Indian yr/yr inflation rises to 7.99 pct in week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-02-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's year-on-year inflation rate measured by the wholesale price index rose to 7.99 percent in the week ending February 8 from 7.73 percent in the previous week, the Industry Ministry said on Sunday.</p>
<p>    WHOLESALE PRICES   Feb 8, 1997  Feb 1, 1997  Feb 10, 1996</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change    +7.99	   +7.73	   +4.42</p>
<p>    Index (base=1981/82)  321.5	   320.6	   297.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are preliminary except for those for the week ended February 10, 1996.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
